WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:04.173
You dry-ran the runbook's own
scripts: a pre-flight check,

3
00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:08.863
changes recorded with their rollback, a
smoke test that says no-go on fixtures,

4
00:00:08.863 --> 00:00:12.821
an evidence check against the
requirement rows, and a production

5
00:00:12.821 --> 00:00:16.925
pre-flight that refuses to promote
without a live, passing test stage.

6
00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:21.746
The evidence an ISSO keeps, for each
stage: the settings file and its hash,

7
00:00:21.746 --> 00:00:26.078
the pre-flight results, the
validation kit runs before and after,

8
00:00:26.078 --> 00:00:31.389
each kit's outputs, the smoke report, the
evidence package and its verify result,

9
00:00:31.389 --> 00:00:34.331
the deploy record and
the rollback scripts,

10
00:00:34.331 --> 00:00:37.600
and the evidence folder
with its evidence check.

11
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.301
For production, add the
promotion record and

12
00:00:40.301 --> 00:00:43.075
seven days of chained
drift packages per wave.

13
00:00:43.075 --> 00:00:46.738
Before you run a stage, work
through the Chapter 10 checklist.

14
00:00:46.738 --> 00:00:48.887
And that's the end of the learning path.

15
00:00:48.887 --> 00:00:53.740
The path's index and the Labs page
list every module and every lab.
